    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Atalia min Akajia oneno wode oto woko, ci en ocako jwero ot ker woko ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Yekoceba, nya pa kabaka Joram, ma lamiŋ Akajia, otino Yoaci wod pa Akajia okwalo woko ki i kin awobe pa kabaka ma gibenekogi-ni, ci okano en ki lapidine i kicika mo me buto. En okane woko kit meno, omiyo Atalia pe onoŋo kome ci latin obwot, pe gineko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci en obedo ki Yoaci mwaka abicel, kun kano i ot pa Rwot, i kare ma Atalia tye ka loyo lobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento i mwaka me abirone Yekoyada ocwalo kwena ci gikelo ludito ma lulo buca mony pa jo mi ya ma pa jo Kari ki pa lukur-piny, ci en oterogi i ot pa Rwot, oketo gicikke kwedgi, omiyogi gukwoŋo kwoŋ ki i ot pa Rwot, ka onyuto botgi wod pa kabaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En ocikogi ni, “Man aye gin ma wubitiyo: dul acel me adekke ma i komwu, jo ma gia i dog ticgi i nino me cabit, ma gikuro ot pa kabaka, gibikuro gaŋ kai, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun dul acel me adekke mukene gikuro doggola me Cur, ki acel me adek gikuro doggola ma i ŋe lukur-piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dulwu aryo ma gibino i dog ticgi i nino me cabit pi kuro ot pa Rwot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gibirumo kabaka dyere, kun dano acel acel tye ki jami lwennye i ciŋe. Ka dano mo obino ka temo baro kin tyenwu, gibineko woko. Wubibedo ki kabaka ka ma en bicito iye ducu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ludito mony gutiyo gin ducu kit ma ajwaka Yekoyada ocikogi kwede; ladit mony acel acel okelo jone ma onoŋo gubea woko ki i dog ticgi i nino me cabit, ki jo ma nene gibino i dog tic i nino me cabit. Gin ducu gucito bot ajwaka Yekoyada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajwaka ocako miyo bot ludito me mony lwak toni ki kwodi ma onoŋo yam pa kabaka Daudi, ma onoŋo tye i ot pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lukur-piny gucuŋ kun dano acel acel omako jami lwennye i ciŋe, cakke wa i agikki ot yo tuŋ acuc ki nio kwede wa i agikki ot yo tuŋ acam, kun girumo keno tyer ki ot bene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ ocako kelo wod pa kabaka, oketo lalukana i wiye, ka orwako ogul makwar i ŋut ciŋe, ka gituco atir ni en doŋ kabaka, ci giwire ki moo; ci dano gudaŋŋe kun gidoŋo ciŋgi kun giwacci, “Kabaka obed kwo nakanaka!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Atalia owinyo woo pa lukurpiny ki pa lwak, ci ocito bot lwak wa i ot pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.23.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Luker 23.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka oniyo piny, ci oneno kabaka ocun ka ŋet wir, kit ma kabaka cun kwede, kun ludito me mony ki lukut-tum gurumo kabaka, ki lwak ducu gubedo ka wo ki tum kun cwinygi yom. Atalia ocako yeco boŋone, kun kok ni, “Roro yai! Roro!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajwaka Yekoyada ociko ludito ma giloyo wi mony ni, “Wukel dako-nu woko ki i kin tyen; wunek wa jo ma gilubo kore ducu.” Pien ajwaka onoŋo tamo ni, “Pe myero gineke ki i ot pa Rwot.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gucako keto ciŋgi i kom Atalia, ci guwok kwede ki i doggola ma aguragura donyo kwede, guo wa i ot pa kabaka, ci guneke kenyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yekoyada ocako keto gicikke i kin Rwot ki kabaka ki lwak, wek gubed lwak pa Rwot; ka dok oketo gicikke i kin kabaka ki lwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwak ducu gucako mol gucito i ot pa Baal ci gumuko gureto woko piny; guturo keno tyerre ducu ki calle guŋido woko matitino, Ci guneko Matan ma ajwaka pa Baal ki i nyim keno tyer. Lacen ajwaka ocako keto jo ma gigwoko ot pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci otero ludito ma lulo buca mony pa jo miya, ki jo Kari, ki lukur-piny ki lwak ma i lobo ducu, gucako kelo kabaka woko nia ki i ot pa Rwot kun gidorre giwok ki i doggola pa lukurpiny nio kwede wa i ot pa kabaka. Kabaka ocako bedo piny i wi komker pa luker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno lwak ma i lobo ducu cwinygi obedo yom; gaŋ ocako kwe mot ki i ŋe to pa Atalia ma gineko ki pala lucwan i ot pa kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
